<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Monday that shares of Eastman Chemical Co were unavailable for after hours trade because of news.</p>
<p>After the market closed, Eastman Chemical reported third quarter earnings of $1.22 a share, compared to $1.81 a share the previous third quarter.</p>
<p>The NYSE said that shares of Corimon SACA and Fruehauf Trailer Corp were also unavailable for after hours trade.</p>
</text>
